{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q067","title":"Ciclesonide：把類固醇活化留在氣道","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"16e4f76cbb872d47980409484debe0783401c7e65a55f338ff642c46e3a13110","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_5a01acfb690c8191b3796bc453f98a37","sourceAnchor":"q67","shortHtml":"<p>答案是<strong>B，ciclesonide</strong>。它本身的糖皮質素活性較低，經氣道組織的<strong>酯解酶（esterase）</strong>水解後，形成較具活性的<strong>desisobutyryl-ciclesonide</strong>，常簡寫為<strong>des-CIC或des-ciclesonide</strong>。考題的關鍵組合是「吸入性類固醇、前驅藥、局部酯解活化」。</p>","html":"<div><h2>Ciclesonide：把類固醇活化留在氣道</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：B</p><h3>Ciclesonide先以低活性前驅藥進入，再於氣道活化</h3>\n<p>答案是<strong>B，ciclesonide</strong>。它本身的糖皮質素活性較低，經氣道組織的<strong>酯解酶（esterase）</strong>水解後，形成較具活性的<strong>desisobutyryl-ciclesonide</strong>，常簡寫為<strong>des-CIC或des-ciclesonide</strong>。考題的關鍵組合是「吸入性類固醇、前驅藥、局部酯解活化」。</p>\n<h3>口咽接觸與氣道活化，是不同層次的概念</h3>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:800px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0296010296010296\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0cb1ca65377a13355204b3ca61194ed2909c61a1f7b4a5803e13c8d38aa20b75.jpg\" alt=\"氣道CT三維重建前面與側面觀：胸外氣道及中央氣道位置，末梢細氣道未能顯示\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"777\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0cb1ca65377a13355204b3ca61194ed2909c61a1f7b4a5803e13c8d38aa20b75.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>先辨認上方<strong>胸外氣道（Extrathoracic）</strong>與下方<strong>中央氣道（Central）</strong>。末梢細氣道太小，原圖註明未在此CT中顯示。本圖用於空間定位，並非ciclesonide的藥物沉積量圖。圖：<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8219200/#f1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Usmani等，Figure 1</a>；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>，完整原圖。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1200px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.2944983818770226\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0975d9d64c8d338aaa8d1c8dfb36bd929777b3be33c4a691bbad9e703a19704e.jpg\" alt=\"Ciclesonide經酯水解形成desisobutyryl-ciclesonide，後者可形成可逆脂肪酸酯結合\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"927\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/0975d9d64c8d338aaa8d1c8dfb36bd929777b3be33c4a691bbad9e703a19704e.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>看上半部：左側<strong>Hydrolysis（水解）</strong>去除酯基，形成右上活性des-CIC。右下是可逆脂肪酸酯結合，與局部藥物滯留相關，和第一次水解活化不同。圖：<a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/1471-2210-7-7#Fig1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sato等，Figure 1</a>；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 2.0</a>，完整原圖。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<p>吸入藥物有一部分接觸口咽，一部分進入較深氣道。Ciclesonide的特性包括<strong>口咽活性代謝物暴露較低</strong>，以及在肺部轉成活性形式；這有助於減少口咽局部的類固醇作用。研究中的沉積差異也受吸入器與配方影響，不能只由「前驅藥」三字推定所有製劑的沉積比例。</p>\n<h3>為何能降低口腔念珠菌病的傾向？</h3>\n<p>吸入性類固醇若在口咽形成較高的局部活性暴露，可能削弱局部防禦，增加念珠菌過度生長的機會。Ciclesonide在口咽的轉化較少，因而<strong>有較低口咽不良反應的藥理基礎</strong>。其目的仍是將抗發炎作用送到氣道，而非直接殺死念珠菌。</p>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>選項</th><th>本題辨識重點</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>A　budesonide</strong></td><td>本身已有糖皮質素活性；局部可逆脂肪酸酯化不等於需先酯解才活化的前驅藥</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>B　ciclesonide</strong></td><td><strong>經酯解形成活性des-CIC</strong>，符合題幹</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>C　flunisolide</strong></td><td>本身為具活性的吸入性類固醇，不符合此特定前驅藥描述</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>D　mometasone</strong></td><td>常見為mometasone furoate；本身具有受體活性，不能因名稱含酯類就推定與ciclesonide相同</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>前驅藥降低風險，不代表完全沒有局部副作用</h3>\n<p>Ciclesonide仿單仍列有<strong>口咽念珠菌感染、聲音沙啞</strong>等風險。吸入後依製劑指示<strong>漱口並吐掉</strong>、確認吸入技巧，仍有意義；若出現白色斑塊或持續口咽症狀，須評估是否感染。</p>\n<p>吸入性類固醇主要作為<strong>抗發炎控制藥</strong>。Ciclesonide本身不是快速支氣管擴張劑，這項前驅藥設計也不會讓它變成急性氣喘發作的立即緩解藥。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第67題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=9f6112fb-78ef-43cf-8ae3-36370eb45468\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alvesco仿單：酯解活化、口咽念珠菌風險與漱口</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15824911/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原研究：ciclesonide與budesonide之口咽沉積比較</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15647406/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原研究：ciclesonide口咽沉積及des-CIC轉化</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8219200/#f1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Omar S Usmani、Benjamin Mignot、Irvin Kendall、Roberta De Maria、Daniela Cocconi、George Georges、Nicola Scichilone：吸入路徑的口咽與胸內氣道定位</a></li><li><a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/1471-2210-7-7#Fig1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sato, Hideyuki、Nave, Ruediger、Nonaka, Takashi、Yoshihisa, Nishibe、Atsuhiro, Nagano、Mochizuki, Tsutomu、Takahama, Shigehiro、Kondo, Shiro、Wingertzahn, Mark：Ciclesonide水解成活性des-ciclesonide</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：B"}